# the idle session (TUI-DESIGN-3 §3.9; the owner's directive of 2026-09-23): settle, then 12 s alone — the settled mark is COMMITTED as the
# first scrollback block and a committed mark is never repainted (the idle sweep covers the splash alone), so run-smoke.sh counts ZERO frames
# between the commit and the marker key's echo, no band frame, the mark committed once and never redrawn, zero clears, 6 rows
expect \x1b\[\?25l
expect step 0/
expect ◆(?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)* (?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)*\d+\.\d+\.\d+
mark settled
expect sess \$
sleep 12
mark idled
send h
expect (?:›|>) (?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)*h
send \x03
expect Say hi
send /exit
sleep 0.2
send \r
eof
